  "story": {
    "zh": "一道海峡几乎把这里隔成了两座岛，只在南边留下一条窄窄的沙洲。谁守着沙洲，谁就能两边都看得到。",
    "en": "A strait almost splits this place into twin islands, leaving only a narrow sandbar in the south. Whoever holds the sandbar can see both shores."
  },
